SUMMARY:8th Grade Clap Out
DESCRIPTION:We will be celebrating our 8th grade students with a clap out on Wednesday\, June 5th. Following the morning assembly\, all students\, teachers and staff will clap out 8th grade as they transition for the last time at SCS. Congrats to our 8th grade class!
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/8th-grade-clap-out-2/
CATEGORIES:School Events
END:VEVENT
