SUMMARY:Elementary Classroom Takeover (Student Only Event)
DESCRIPTION:On June 3rd\, students in KG-5th grade will get to participate in a classroom takeover event! Immediately following the morning assembly\, each grade will get to spend time in the classroom they will have next year\, ask questions with the teacher\, and participate in some other fun activities. This will be a fantastic way of getting ready for the next year and help with any new classroom nerves!
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/elementary-classroom-takeover-student-only-event-3/
CATEGORIES:School Events
END:VEVENT
