UID:11455-1748822400-1748908799@sherwoodcharterschool.org
SUMMARY:Elementary Field Day
DESCRIPTION:Elementary students will have a chance to participate in a school Field Day (student only) on June 2nd! \nFifth grade will assist Mr. Lamb in hosting the event for grades K-4th. Fifth grade will be rewarded for their hard work with a trip to Snyder Park concluding the event. All students will be given a popsicle (juice based\, dye free) at the end of their Field Day session.* Please send students with a water bottle & dressed in athletic wear. Leggings must have shorts/skirts worn over them. \n*For students with special dietary requirements\, please contact the office in advance for accommodations.
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/elementary-field-day-4/
CATEGORIES:School Events
END:VEVENT
