UID:11453-1748513700-1748518200@sherwoodcharterschool.org
SUMMARY:Middle School Tour and House Sorting Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Parents & Guardians of incoming SCS middle school students are invited to join a brief middle school tour led by Principal Raboli on May 29th. Following the tour\, you will get to observe the House Sorting Ceremony where your student will be sorted into their Middle School House and participate in their first House Competition.* \nView the flyer here. \n  \n*New Sherwood Charter School middle school students who have been accepted to the 2025-2026 school year are welcome to attend and participate in the tour\, ceremony and house competition.
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/middle-school-tour-and-house-sorting-ceremony-2/
CATEGORIES:School Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/MS-Tour-House-Sorting-Ceremony-2025.jpg
END:VEVENT
